# CodFlow dashboard (Astro) — local development secrets
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in your values.
# (.dev.vars is gitignored — your real values never get committed.)

# ── Required for local dev ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Better Auth signing secret. Generate with:  openssl rand -hex 32
# Must match the secret used by any worker sharing the same D1 database.
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=

# HMAC key shared with cod-server for MCP OAuth login tickets (must be >= 32
# bytes). Set the SAME value on cod-server. Generate with:  openssl rand -hex 32
# MCP_LOGIN_TICKET_SECRET=

# In production both values are set with `wrangler secret put`, never in code.
